  "summary": "I'm a Staff Data & Applied AI Engineer and technical lead with 10+ years of experience building production systems across healthcare simulation and legal technology.\nI design governed data platforms with Microsoft Fabric, Azure Data Factory, Medallion architecture, lakehouse and data-warehousing patterns, telemetry processing, Power BI, data governance, PII removal, and secure legacy-data migration.\nI apply Azure OpenAI, Azure AI Foundry models and agents, prompt engineering, and agentic workflow orchestration to curated enterprise data. My AI work also includes speech recognition, Microsoft LUIS/CLU, computer vision, NVIDIA Jetson, ONNX Runtime, Gemini, and ML.NET.\nAt Gaumard Scientific, I serve as a Staff Software Engineer and technical lead for data and applied AI systems, setting architecture and delivery priorities, mentoring engineers, coordinating cross-functional stakeholders, and owning reliable production releases.\nAt Seven LG, I serve as a Staff Consulting Software Engineer and Technical Lead for MaatDesk. I architect a multi-tenant Azure platform and manage and mentor a distributed team of six developers through planning, design, code review, CI/CD, and production releases.\nI focus on turning governed data into secure, production-ready AI systems that deliver measurable business and operational results.",
